---
pagination:
  data: collections.posts
  size: 1
  alias: post
permalink: "/medium-import{{ post.url }}index.html"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- A plain copy of each post for Medium's story importer: absolute image links and captions moved out of their figures, because the importer drops pictures inside captioned figures. Not indexed; the canonical link points at the real post. -#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ post.data.title }}</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ post.url }}">
</head>
<body>
<article>
<h1>{{ post.data.title }}</h1>
{%- if post.data.excerpt %}
<p>{{ post.data.excerpt | trimText }}</p>
{%- endif %}
{%- if post.data.feature_image %}
<figure><img src="{{ site.url }}{{ post.data.feature_image }}" alt=""></figure>
{%- endif %}
{{ post.content | forFeed | forMediumImport | safe }}
</article>
</body>
</html>
